:::


We can create a boolean (see @sec-variable_types) column showing if *H. tumulorum* is detected or undetected at each site using `mutate()` based on the `n_observed` column - if `n_observed` is > 0, this species was detected.

We also need to join with the site metadata table to get the additional info about the sampling sites.


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
spp_presence <- spp_counts |>
  mutate(detected = n_observed > 0) |>
  left_join(site_metadata)

gt(head(spp_presence))
```

